    {
      "text": "After Rising Cloud City is given to Demon Immortal Qi Jue and Profound Frost House, Dragon Soul Dark Castle, Red River Pavilion, and Red Heavenly Altar leave the mountain, only Unbreakable Golden Fortress and Scarlet Palace remain on Book Mountain.",
